<title>USA: PHLX to trade Trusted Information options.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade Trusted Information options.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Tuesday it would list options on Trusted Information Systems Inc on April 11.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would open with strike prices of 10, 12-1/2 and 15 and initial expirations in May, June, September and December.</p>
<p>Position limits of 7,500 contracts have been set.</p>
<p>G-Bar Ltd has been named the specialist unit for the options, the PHLX said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
